<h1 align="center">Picomatch</h1>

<p align="center">
<a href="https://npmjs.org/package/picomatch">
<img src="https://img.shields.io/npm/v/picomatch.svg" alt="version">
</a>
<a href="https://github.com/micromatch/picomatch/actions?workflow=Tests">
